  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">U.S. Department of State: Nonproliferation Assistance Programs - Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty Organization (CTBTO), Preparatory Commission (Special Contributions)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Comprehensive Nuclear-Test-Ban Treaty Organization (CTBTO), Preparatory Commission (Special Contributions) are used to enhance the verification regime associated with the Comprehensive Nuclear Test-Ban Treaty (CTBT), and increasing the capability of the regime to contribute to U.S. national capabilities for nuclear explosion monitoring. The Provisional Technical Secretariat (PTS) of the Preparatory Commission for the Comprehensive Nuclear Test-Ban Treaty Organization (CTBTO) will increase the effectiveness and efficiency of the CTBT verification regime with this U.S. support.</narrative>
  </description>
